{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type SchemaInput = \n  | StandardJSONSchemaV1<any, any>\n  | StandardSchemaV1<any, any>\n  | JSONSchema;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L172","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:172"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Union type for schema input - can be any Standard Schema compliant validator,\nany Standard JSON Schema compliant schema, or a plain JSONSchema object."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Standard JSON Schema compliant libraries (carry the JSON-schema converter):"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Zod v4.2+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ArkType v2.1.28+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Valibot v1.2+ (via "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toStandardJsonSchema()"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@valibot/to-json-schema"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"StandardSchemaV1 covers libraries whose published types only expose the\nvalidator surface — Zod's core "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"$ZodType['~standard']"},{"type":"text","value":" is currently typed\nas "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StandardSchemaV1.Props"},{"type":"text","value":" even though the runtime attaches the\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"jsonSchema"},{"type":"text","value":" converter, so this branch is what makes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InferSchemaType"},{"type":"text","value":"\nrecover the inferred type for callers using "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"z.ZodType<T>"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"see","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://standardschema.dev/json-schema"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"see","text":"See","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype SchemaInput = \n  | StandardJSONSchemaV1<any, any>\n  | StandardSchemaV1<any, any>\n  | JSONSchema;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:172](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L172)\n\nUnion type for schema input - can be any Standard Schema compliant validator,\nany Standard JSON Schema compliant schema, or a plain JSONSchema object.\n\nStandard JSON Schema compliant libraries (carry the JSON-schema converter):\n- Zod v4.2+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- ArkType v2.1.28+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- Valibot v1.2+ (via `toStandardJsonSchema()` from `@valibot/to-json-schema`)\n\nStandardSchemaV1 covers libraries whose published types only expose the\nvalidator surface — Zod's core `$ZodType['~standard']` is currently typed\nas `StandardSchemaV1.Props` even though the runtime attaches the\n`jsonSchema` converter, so this branch is what makes `InferSchemaType`\nrecover the inferred type for callers using `z.ZodType<T>`.\n\n## See\n\nhttps://standardschema.dev/json-schema\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SchemaInput\ntitle: SchemaInput\n---\n\n```ts\ntype SchemaInput = \n  | StandardJSONSchemaV1<any, any>\n  | StandardSchemaV1<any, any>\n  | JSONSchema;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:172](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L172)\n\nUnion type for schema input - can be any Standard Schema compliant validator,\nany Standard JSON Schema compliant schema, or a plain JSONSchema object.\n\nStandard JSON Schema compliant libraries (carry the JSON-schema converter):\n- Zod v4.2+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- ArkType v2.1.28+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- Valibot v1.2+ (via `toStandardJsonSchema()` from `@valibot/to-json-schema`)\n\nStandardSchemaV1 covers libraries whose published types only expose the\nvalidator surface — Zod's core `$ZodType['~standard']` is currently typed\nas `StandardSchemaV1.Props` even though the runtime attaches the\n`jsonSchema` converter, so this branch is what makes `InferSchemaType`\nrecover the inferred type for callers using `z.ZodType<T>`.\n\n## See\n\nhttps://standardschema.dev/json-schema\n"}
